on Speed and Focus: Due to the time-limited nature of the game, players need to quickly aim and shoot targets within the given timeframe, significantly improving reaction speed and focus.\n\nImproves Hand-Eye Coordination: The game requires players to maintain precise aim on moving targets, which greatly aids in enhancing hand-eye coordination.\n\nProvides a Safe Shooting Experience: Practicing shooting in a virtual environment allows players to experience the thrill and challenges of shooting while avoiding the potential risks associated with real-world shooting.\n\nGradual Skill Improvement: With the three different difficulty levels, players can gradually improve their shooting skills, allowing them to tackle more challenging scenarios.\n\nRelaxation and Stress Relief: The shooting game offers a way for players to relax, providing a temporary escape from the stresses of daily life by focusing on shooting targets.", "short_description": "This virtual shooting range game allows players to enhance their shooting skills in a safe environment. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ecom.iscom.sg/index.php?route=information%2Finformation&language=en-gb&information_id=3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IS COM XR Apps Developer", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ecom.iscom.sg/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "sup